Package: gh0st-media
Version: @GH0ST_VERSION@
Architecture: arm64
Maintainer: Gh0st OS <15324879+therezor@users.noreply.github.com>
Section: graphics
Priority: optional
Depends: gh0st (>= @GH0ST_VERSION@), libstdc++6, libjpeg62-turbo,
 libavformat61, libavcodec61, libavutil59, libswscale8, libswresample5, libpulse0,
 libwebp7, libwebpdemux2, libavfilter10, libass9, libheif1, libheif-plugin-ffmpegdec,
 libraw23
Description: the Gh0st OS pictures, video and music app
 Media shows pictures, plays video and music, and browses them as a
 gallery. gh0st-mediad, its helper, decodes: ffmpeg's libraries for most
 formats, libheif for phone photos, LibRaw for camera RAW, libwebpdemux for
 animated WebP and libass for subtitles. libavfilter, libass, libheif and
 LibRaw load only when a file needs them.
